      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我走到曼城茶座的身旁，\n爱丽速子也跟着到她的身边。\n就这样──",
      "source_fingerprint": "df22d9d3523f3a07552956c9de3b9e2a6ca8eb8db62a85b0ea2b2e472756ac5a",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
