      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "曼城茶座的国外远征\n在出发前一刻取消。下一个目标\n改回国内的“宝冢纪念”。",
      "source_fingerprint": "73100c9aaed879bbd8381f3e2dba81d38b49c2df5a414a6486925a94d8442ac5",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1025/storytimeline_501025116.json",
      "json_path": [
